      "source": [
        "# 🛒 Customer Segmentation & Recommendation System\n",
        "## End-to-End Retail Analytics Pipeline with GenAI Layer\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "> **Dataset**: UCI Online Retail (Chen et al., 2012) — ~541 909 transactions, UK retailer, 2010–2011  \n",
        "> **Goal**: Segment customers, build a recommendation engine, and enrich insights with a GenAI layer  \n",
        "> **References**:  \n",
        "> - [Chen et al., 2012] D. Chen, S. Sain, K. Guo — *Data Mining for the Online Retail Industry*, JDSA  \n",
        "> - [Tibshirani et al., 2001] — *Estimating the number of clusters via the Gap Statistic*, JRSS-B  \n",
        "> - [Campello et al., 2013] — *Density-Based Clustering Based on Hierarchical Density Estimates*, PKDD  \n",
        "> - [Blattberg, Kim & Neslin, 2008] — *Database Marketing*, Springer  \n",
        "> - [Linden et al., 2003] — *Amazon.com Recommendations: Item-to-Item Collaborative Filtering*, IEEE Internet  \n",
        "> - [Von Luxburg, 2010] — *Clustering Stability: An Overview*, FnTML  \n",
        "> - [Gupta & Lehmann, 2005] — *Managing Customers as Investments*, Wharton School Publishing  \n",
        "> - [Müller & Guido, 2016] — *Introduction to Machine Learning with Python*, O'Reilly\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "e6574496",
