        "---\n",
        "## Section 4 — RFM Scoring & Rule-Based Segmentation\n",
        "\n",
        "RFM scoring uses **quintiles** (1–5) to rank customers on each dimension.  \n",
        "Rule-based segments follow the framework of [Blattberg, Kim & Neslin, 2008].\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 23,
      "id": "10528d9d",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "10528d9d",
