      "source": [
        "# ── RFM Treemap — R vs F coloured by mean Monetary ───────────────────────────\n",
        "rfm_pivot = (customer_df.groupby(['R_Score','F_Score'])\n",
        "             .agg(Mean_Monetary=('Monetary','mean'),\n",
        "                  Count=('Monetary','count'))\n",
        "             .reset_index())\n",
        "rfm_pivot['Label'] = 'R' + rfm_pivot['R_Score'].astype(str) + ' F' + rfm_pivot['F_Score'].astype(str)\n",
        "\n",
        "fig = px.treemap(rfm_pivot, path=['Label'], values='Count',\n",
        "                 color='Mean_Monetary',\n",
        "                 color_continuous_scale='RdYlGn',\n",
        "                 title='🗂️ RFM Score Matrix Treemap (size=customer count, color=mean spend)')\n",
        "fig.show()\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "14750ba0",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "14750ba0"
      },
      "source": [
        "### RFM Segment Business Profiles\n",
        "\n",
        "| Segment | Description | Recommended Action |\n",
        "|---|---|---|\n",
        "| **Champions** | Bought recently, buy often, spend the most | Reward, ask for reviews, early access |\n",
        "| **Loyal Customers** | Consistent buyers with good spend | Upsell, cross-sell, loyalty programme |\n",
        "| **Potential Loyalists** | Recent customers with mid-frequency | Onboarding series, product education |\n",
        "| **Recent Customers** | Bought recently but not often | Activation campaigns, second purchase incentive |\n",
        "| **At Risk** | Good past customers but not buying recently | Win-back emails, exclusive offers |\n",
        "| **Can't Lose Them** | High-value but declining | Personal outreach, VIP programme |\n",
        "| **Hibernating** | Low on all dimensions | Reactivation or removal from active lists |\n",
        "| **Lost** | Long gone | Archive or minimal-cost campaigns |\n"
      ]
    },
