      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "## Section 5 — Preprocessing for Clustering\n",
        "\n",
        "Steps: outlier detection → feature scaling → VIF analysis → PCA dimensionality reduction.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 26,
      "id": "99aa551a",
      "metadata": {
