        "---\n",
        "## Section 7 — Cluster Evaluation\n",
        "\n",
        "We use three complementary metrics [Müller & Guido, 2016]:\n",
        "- **Silhouette Score** — cohesion vs. separation (higher = better)\n",
        "- **Calinski-Harabász Index** — between/within cluster ratio (higher = better)\n",
        "- **Davies-Bouldin Score** — average similarity to nearest cluster (lower = better)\n",
        "\n",
        "We also assess **cluster stability** via Bootstrap resampling [Von Luxburg, 2010].\n"
      ]
    },
