        "def build_prompt(cluster_id):\n",
        "    sub  = customer_clean[customer_clean['Cluster'] == cluster_id]\n",
        "    cent = centroid_norm.loc[cluster_id]\n",
        "    feats_str = \"\\n\".join(f\"  - {f}: {v:.3f}\" for f, v in cent.items())\n",
        "    top_country = (df_sales[df_sales['CustomerID'].isin(sub.index)]\n",
        "                   ['Country'].value_counts().index[0])\n",
        "\n",
        "    # ── Comparaison relative : rang de ce cluster pour chaque métrique clé ──\n",
        "    stats = customer_clean.groupby('Cluster')[['Recency','Frequency','Monetary','AOV','Cancellation_Rate']].mean()\n",
        "    ranks = stats.rank(ascending=True).loc[cluster_id]  # rang 1=plus bas, K=plus haut\n",
        "    n = OPTIMAL_K\n",
        "    relative = \"\\n\".join(\n",
        "        f\"  - {col}: rang {int(ranks[col])}/{n} ({'🔴 bas' if ranks[col] <= n*0.33 else '🟡 moyen' if ranks[col] <= n*0.66 else '🟢 élevé'})\"\n",
        "        for col in ['Recency','Frequency','Monetary','AOV','Cancellation_Rate']\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "    return f\"\"\"Tu es un expert retail analytics. Génère une fiche business en français.\n",
        "\n",
        "RÈGLE ABSOLUE : Le nom du segment NE DOIT PAS contenir les mots \"Britannique\", \"Fidèle\", \"Loyal\" ou \"UK\".\n",
        "Le nom doit capturer le COMPORTEMENT D'ACHAT distinctif, pas la géographie.\n",
        "\n",
        "CLUSTER {cluster_id} — {len(sub):,} clients | Pays dominant : {top_country}\n",
        "Recency: {sub['Recency'].mean():.0f}j | Frequency: {sub['Frequency'].mean():.1f} | Monetary: £{sub['Monetary'].mean():.0f} | AOV: £{sub['AOV'].mean():.0f}\n",
        "Annulations: {sub['Cancellation_Rate'].mean():.1%} | Produits uniques: {sub['Unique_Products_Purchased'].mean():.0f}\n",
        "\n",
        "RANG RELATIF (1=plus bas, {OPTIMAL_K}=plus haut parmi tous les clusters) :\n",
        "{relative}\n",
        "\n",
        "Centroïdes normalisés :\n",
        "{feats_str}\n",
        "\n",
        "EXEMPLES de bons noms basés sur le comportement (adapte au profil réel) :\n",
        "- Fréquence basse + AOV élevé → \"Les Acheteurs Impulsifs Premium\"\n",
        "- Fréquence haute + Monetary élevé → \"Les Gros Commanditaires\"\n",
        "- Recency haute + Frequency basse → \"Les Dormants à Réactiver\"\n",
        "- Cancellation élevé → \"Les Indécis Volatils\"\n",
        "- Frequency=1 → \"Les One-Shot\"\n",
        "\n",
        "Structure :\n",
        "🎯 Nom du segment : [NOM UNIQUE basé sur le comportement, PAS la géographie]\n",
        "📝 Description : [2-3 phrases sur CE QUI DISTINGUE ce cluster des autres]\n",
        "🔑 Caractéristiques clés : [3 bullets avec chiffres précis]\n",
        "💼 Recommandations CRM : [3 actions spécifiques à CE profil]\n",
        "💰 Potentiel CLTV : [élevé/moyen/faible + justification en 1 phrase]\"\"\"\n",
        "\n",
        "# Génération des narratives pour chaque cluster\n",
        "cluster_narratives = {}\n",
        "for cid in range(OPTIMAL_K):\n",
        "    print(f\"\\n{'='*60}\\nCluster {cid}\\n{'='*60}\")\n",
        "    narrative = call_groq(build_prompt(cid))\n",
        "    cluster_narratives[cid] = narrative\n",
        "    print(narrative)"
      ]
